{"name": "Rune Golf", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531040/extras/61b27b4552e972c48e4d3527f45824f4.poster.avif?t=1778057187\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531040/extras/61b27b4552e972c48e4d3527f45824f4.webm?t=1778057187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531040/extras/61b27b4552e972c48e4d3527f45824f4.mp4?t=1778057187\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPLORE THE RUINS OF A LOST WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rune Golf is an <strong>immersive, contemplative golf game</strong> where you guide a solitary golf ball through the ruins of a forgotten civilization full of mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore lost worlds, uncover their secrets,</strong> and make your way through each level with precision, curiosity, and determination. You are free to explore every stage as much as you like, but if you exceed the allowed number of shots, the final hole will close.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531040/extras/e6b940917d0f5067b7e3f227b7301846.poster.avif?t=1778057187\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531040/extras/e6b940917d0f5067b7e3f227b7301846.webm?t=1778057187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531040/extras/e6b940917d0f5067b7e3f227b7301846.mp4?t=1778057187\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>UNIQUE ENVIRONMENTS AND MECHANICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> </strong> <br/><strong>Travel through varied environments where each level introduces new terrain, obstacles, and mechanics, pushing you to rethink both your trajectory and the way you play.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ADJUST</strong> the power and angle of your shots to make your way through each level and reach the final hole without exceeding the allowed number of strokes!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CHANGE</strong> your trajectory at any time: a slow-motion mode lets you pull off extraordinary shots!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TAKE YOUR TIME</strong> and <strong>EXPLORE EACH LEVEL</strong> \u2014 don\u2019t rush your shots; scout the area, plan your route, and optimize your way to the hole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531040/extras/f2ffc7f9cd74261a938e2d74234b6b16.poster.avif?t=1778057187\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531040/extras/f2ffc7f9cd74261a938e2d74234b6b16.webm?t=1778057187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531040/extras/f2ffc7f9cd74261a938e2d74234b6b16.mp4?t=1778057187\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>HIDDEN SECRETS, A FORGOTTEN STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Rune Golf is also <strong>a deeply narrative experience.</strong> For players who wish to take exploration further, many mysteries await, allowing them to gradually piece together the past of a fallen world through the stories of unique characters.<strong></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>INTERACT with the creatures</strong> that inhabit these ruins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>UNCOVER forgotten notes</strong> to unravel the secrets of this lost civilization.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531040/extras/15f1b7cd16b9fc4e9ac68fce922015d0.poster.avif?t=1778057187\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531040/extras/15f1b7cd16b9fc4e9ac68fce922015d0.webm?t=1778057187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531040/extras/15f1b7cd16b9fc4e9ac68fce922015d0.mp4?t=1778057187\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Guide a small golf ball through the ruins of a forgotten civilization, filled with traps and mysteries. Explore the remnants of a lost people, combining skill and curiosity in a unique narrative and contemplative journey!", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2531040/80720f62660305ece2ebad1e331e34e1360dffc9/header.jpg?t=1778057187", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Singleplayer", "Mini Golf", "Precision Platformer", "Exploration", "Relaxing", "Adventure"], "developers": "Owlo Games", "publishers": "Owlo Games", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "2531040", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "6 May 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/S7rNhmudg5g", "first_seen": 1778018400.0, 